OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cold frosty start leading to
OL,6,Fa dry day with long periods of clear
OL,7,Fskies and sunshine. Turning cloudier
OL,8,Ffrom later afternoon. Breezy northerly
OL,9,Fwinds near the coasts.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FDry for most but the odd
OL,12,Flight shower in the north possible.
OL,13,FLong clear spells in the evening but
OL,14,Fturning cloudier overnight. Cold and
OL,15,Ffrosty.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FA mostly dry and cloudy day
OL,18,Fwith bright or sunny intervals
OL,19,Fbreaking through. The odd shower
OL,20,Fpossible but these mainly around the
OL,21,Fcoasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
